 | pass | pass |\n\nAdditionally, because the Rust translation's faulting behaviour used to depend\non `-C debug-assertions`, every phase is also re-run against a **release**\nbuild of the `.so` (`cargo build --release --lib`, which is where\n`[profile.release] panic = \"abort\"` applies) via the `PREMULT_RUST_SO`\nenvironment variable. See `run_all.sh`.\nEOF\necho done","description":"Append row 27 and build-config notes to CONFIGS.md"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4796,"cache_read_input_tokens":127597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4796,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a65eb01-3a90-4dd7-9913-8fac91b28eb5","uuid":"a57605e7-5455-4347-a60d-bb800ca4e82e","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:27:00.166Z"}
